# Everything a run produces is tracked so experiments stay reviewable in git:
# run configs, metrics (JSONL + CSV), predictions, summaries and text logs.
#
# Log files are re-included here because the repository-root .gitignore
# excludes "*.log" globally.
!*.log
!logs/
!logs/*.log
!runs/
!runs/**

# Download logs and dataset download run configurations (manifests, run configs) are not tracked:
logs/download*
runs/download*

# The run index is machine-local: it accumulates absolute paths and raw run
# parameters on every run, so it conflicts constantly and is a standing leak
# risk. Rebuild it from the per-run summary.json files instead.
runs/index.jsonl

# The only exceptions: training weights and exported models. These are large
# binaries and are regenerated by `scripts/train.sh` / `scripts/export_model.sh`.
checkpoints/
exports/
weights/
*.pt
*.pth
*.pte
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.tflite
